# Normalize line endings — see .editorconfig (end_of_line = crlf).
# `text=auto` lets Git normalize text files in the repo (LF) and check them
# out with the platform's native EOL. On Windows (core.autocrlf=true) that
# yields CRLF working files, matching the editorconfig and `dotnet format`.
* text=auto

# Binary assets — never normalize.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
